-- MIVO: NEW database changes only (customer emails; Shopee re-import
-- updates existing products and takes BigSeller discount prices).
-- Run just this file in Supabase → SQL Editor. Safe to run again.
-- Generated by supabase/build-run-all.sh from:
--   customer-emails.sql
